@Humanas.Profile.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7179

### Create profile
POST {{Humanas.Profile.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eren Kamer",
  "headline": "Full Stack Software Developer",
  "skills": ["C#", ".NET", "React"]
}

### Get profile (replace id)
GET {{Humanas.Profile.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get missing profile
GET {{Humanas.Profile.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
